  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Women-led Green Partnership Facility</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Procurement description: The contractor will provide service under the EU-Vietnam Women-led Green Partnership Facility contract to promote the role and the voice of women in gender-responsive green transition processes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Reason for purchasing: The European Union&#xbf;s (EU) Multiannual Indicative Program for cooperation with Viet Nam 2021-2027 (the MIP) foresees climate-responsive digital circular economy as one of EU&#xbf;s priority areas. The EU has ample knowledge and experience to share and can build on its existing strong international cooperation to assist Viet Nam in key policy areas relating to the EU&#xbf;s Green Deal and EU&#xbf;s Gender Action Plan III. In addition to that, the EU intends to strengthen the partnership with social associations and organizations (including non-state-actors and private sector) and local authorities to promote gender-responsive green transition in its cooperation with Viet Nam.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
